---
import Button from "../common/Button.astro";
---

<section class="section final-cta" id="contact">
	<h2 class="text-headline-lg">Want to see where your workflow is leaking time or revenue?</h2>
	<p class="text-body-section">
		Book a short audit-fit call. We’ll talk through your current workflow,
		your biggest bottlenecks, and whether a workflow audit makes sense.
	</p>
	<Button href="mailto:hello@arksystems.ca?subject=Workflow Audit Call" variant="primary" showArrow>
		Book a Workflow Audit Call
	</Button>
	<small class="text-caption">No hype. No pressure. Just a practical conversation about your operations.</small>
</section>
